      "content": "<h2>Why Generic SEO No Longer Works</h2>\n<p>Search engines now prioritize topical authority, deep user intent satisfaction, and Core Web Vitals over keyword density. Here is how modern businesses dominate competitive search landscapes.</p>\n\n<h3>1. Semantic Topic Clusters</h3>\n<p>Rather than ranking individual pages for isolated keywords, structure your website around comprehensive pillar topics supported by linked sub-articles that thoroughly address user queries.</p>\n\n<h3>2. Core Web Vitals & Technical Speed</h3>\n<p>A fast website directly improves ranking performance and conversion rates. Key metrics to monitor:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Largest Contentful Paint (LCP):</strong> Keep under 1.8 seconds.</li>\n  <li><strong>Interaction to Next Paint (INP):</strong> Respond to user interactions in under 150ms.</li>\n  <li><strong>Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS):</strong> Maintain near zero shift.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>3. Schema Markup & Entity Search</h3>\n<p>Structured JSON-LD schema helps search engine crawlers understand your services, customer reviews, FAQs, and organization credentials for prominent rich snippet placements.</p>",
